 "origem": "gringa: Índia (hindi): johads, represinhas de terra do Rajastão; a ONG Tarun Bharat Sangh ajudou a construir milhares desde 1985 e o rio Arvari voltou a correr o ano todo nos anos 1990 https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Johad ; https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arvari_River",
 "titulo": "You built a dirt dam that brought a river back 🇮🇳 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "THE RIVER CAME BACK",
 "descripcion": "In Rajasthan, India, villages built thousands of small curved dirt dams called johads. The rain soaked in, the wells filled, and a dead river started flowing again.\n\nWhat should we build next?\n\n#engineering #india #water #rajasthan #shorts",
